          "text": "<p>Senior Frontend Engineer with 6 years on e-commerce and SaaS web apps for more than 2 million users a month. Strong in web performance, design systems, accessibility, and Playwright testing. Lead a team of 4 and maintain an open-source address library used by 40 Vietnamese shops.</p>"
