          "description": "<ul><li>Lead a team of 4 moving the shopping app from a React SPA to Next.js; LCP fell from 4.1 s to 1.9 s.</li><li>Maintain a 60-component React and TypeScript design system for 5 product teams, which cut feature build time by about 30%.</li><li>Run A/B tests on the checkout flow; 6 tests raised conversion by 9%.</li><li>Cut the home page JavaScript bundle from 480 KB to 210 KB with code splitting.</li><li>Keep the checkout at WCAG 2.1 AA with axe checks in CI, after fixing 140 accessibility issues in 3 months.</li></ul>"
