          "description": "<ul><li>Built the inventory dashboard in React and GraphQL for 800 retail businesses.</li><li>Set up Playwright end-to-end tests in GitLab CI, cutting regressions that reached production by 70%.</li><li>Added virtual scrolling to a 10,000-row table, bringing scroll lag down from 3 s to 0.3 s.</li><li>Built an offline-first point-of-sale screen with IndexedDB, so 300 stores kept selling through network outages.</li></ul>"
